{"code":0,"msg":"获取成功","time":"2026-09-17 18:02:26","data":{"id":"a9547315-0c2a-2178-30f2-ebb07836363a","com_id":"4a73cf16-ad06-c35d-9af1-edbb7e786ca5","job_id":"447d134d-800e-d00d-550f-c3a45fd166fd","school_id":"1917e634-eee1-1358-537d-7e36f6f41777","addtime":1789611643,"istop":2,"complaint":0,"resume_count":0,"work_name":"数字IC系统测试工程师","schoolwarn":"请各位同学在求职时提高警惕，凡涉及收取各种费用；几乎不面试就给出录取通知，且到外地就职的招聘等情况，要仔细辨别，谨防上当受骗。","remarks":"<p><strong>工作地点：上海\/宁波 <\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>公司福利：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>1、五险一金+补充商业保险<\/p>\n<p>2、2~4个月的年金<\/p>\n<p>3、除法定带薪假期外，公司额外给予10天的带薪病假<\/p>\n<p>4、每年免费体检<\/p>\n<p>5、团建及公司旅游<\/p>\n<p>6、技术大牛带教<\/p>\n<h2 =\"margin-top: 5pt; margin-bottom: 5pt; text-align: left; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体;\">岗位描述<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/h2>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体;\">本岗位为芯片研发核心校招岗位，面向集成电路、电子通信相关专业应届生培养，无需丰富项目经验。主要负责物联网<\/span>MCU、通信芯片的数字IC功能验证与测试工作，参与FPGA原型调试、芯片回片测试、板级验证及测试文档开发等工作，完整接触芯片测试全研发流程，公司提供系统化带教培养，适合零基础应届生深耕IC测试赛道。<\/span><\/p>\n<h2 =\"text-align: left; margin-top: 5pt; margin-bottom: 5pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体;\">工作职责<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/h2>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">1、理解芯片设计规格与设计方案，参与数字IC模块及整芯片的功能测试、性能测试与稳定性测试工作。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">2、配合团队完成物联网MCU相关模块测试，涵盖总线、DDR、SDRAM、DMA及UART、SPI、SDIO等外设接口的功能验证与调试。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">3、参与FPGA原型平台的功能与性能测试，协助排查测试过程中的基础功能问题、时序异常，整理测试日志与问题清单。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">4、协助开展芯片回片Bring-up测试、板级调试与功能验证，配合团队完成问题定位、复盘与迭代优化。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">5、跟进芯片测试流程，协助整理测试数据、分析测试结果，支撑芯片性能优化与版本迭代。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">6、根据项目规范，完成测试计划、测试报告、技术文档的撰写与归档，养成规范的研发工作习惯。<\/span><\/p>\n<h2 =\"text-align: left; margin-top: 5pt; margin-bottom: 5pt; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体;\">职位要求<\/span><\/span><\/strong><\/h2>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">1、本科及以上学历，微电子、集成电路、电子信息、通信工程、自动化等相关专业<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体;\">。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">2、数字电路、模拟电路基础扎实，了解Verilog HDL基础语法，能够读懂简单RTL代码优先。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">3、了解FPGA基本使用原理、熟悉常用外设接口（UART\/SPI\/SDIO\/DDR）基础原理者优先。<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体;\">有嵌入式开发经验，<\/span><span =\"font-family: 宋体;\">python脚本经验者优先。<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">4、熟悉Modelsim等仿真工具、具备实验室硬件调试经验者优先，无相关经验可系统培养。<\/span><\/p>\n<p =\"text-align: left; margin: 0pt 0pt 0.0001pt; font-family: Calibri; font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-size: 11.0000pt;\">5、对IC芯片测试、芯片研发行业有浓厚兴趣，逻辑思维清晰，学习能力强，工作踏实严谨，具备良好的团队协作能力。<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong>简历投递<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>请以“岗位名称+工作地+姓名”为简历命名，同时作为邮件标题<\/p>\n<p>投递至：<a href=\"mailto:hr1@siwave.com.cn\">hr1@siwave.com.cn<\/a><\/p>\n<p>联系电话：15317651067<\/p>\n<p><strong>办公地址<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>上海地址：上海市浦东新区碧波路690号张江微电子港<\/p>\n<p>宁波地址：浙江省宁波市镇海区中官西路777号宁波市国家大学科技园启航楼2楼西侧 <\/p>\n<p>北京地址：北京市丰台区中核路3号院北京赛欧科园科技孵化中心<\/p>","isdeliver":1,"status":1,"jobInfo":{"id":"447d134d-800e-d00d-550f-c3a45fd166fd","jobtype":1,"work_name":"数字IC系统测试工程师","dalei_id":"1f51f694-4003-4bbf-5bc4-3a87412fc24a","cate_id1":"35aac1df-9761-ed18-445f-f189987ee2cc","cate_id2":"397b9336-c62f-b138-add5-a39e630b1aba","province_id":31,"city_id":3101,"district_id":0,"isday":0,"salary_floor":15000,"salay_ceil":19999,"status":1,"create_id":"cdfc2912-2157-f7b6-1a1f-2e8837f2c6a3","addtime":1789611640,"person_count":"2人","com_id":"4a73cf16-ad06-c35d-9af1-edbb7e786ca5","com_id_name":"宁波矽久微电子有限公司","label":"","xueli_id":"3cc6e5cf-0b81-7e83-8322-fe0273871ab0","laiyuan":2,"sharetype":0,"viewcount":3,"complaint":0,"work_days":"","practice_month":"","chance":3,"isedit":2,"resume_count":0,"expire_time":0,"address":"上海市浦东新区碧波路690号张江微电子港","start_time":0,"end_time":0,"teacher_business":"","refresh_time":0,"is_del":2,"is_expire":1,"exposure":0,"wm_id":null,"certificate":"","job_id":"447d134d-800e-d00d-550f-c3a45fd166fd","remarks":"<p><strong>工作地点：上海\/宁波 <\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>公司福利：<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>1、五险一金+补充商业保险<\/p>\n<p>2、2~4个月的年金<\/p>\n<p>3、除法定带薪假期外，公司额外给予10天的带薪病假<\/p>\n<p>4、每年免费体检<\/p>\n<p>5、团建及公司旅游<\/p>\n<p>6、技术大牛带教<\/p>\n<h2 =\"margin-top: 5pt; margin-bottom: 5pt; text-align: left; font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\"><strong><span =\"font-family: 宋体; font-weight: bold; font-size: 12.0000pt;\"><span =\"fo